    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Incoming!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled for October, where we'll be dropping a new gameplay trailer and releasing a public demo for you to play solo or with coop with friends!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SAVE THE REALM FROM DIVINE WARFARE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Step into a realm torn apart by divine conflict. Lead a party from 5 playable heroes, resurrected by the Goddess of Light, to combat the encroaching forces of darkness. Experience the relentless cycle of death and rebirth as your mortal champions face an eternal struggle between hope and corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>STRATEGIC ROGUELIKE COMBAT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a turn-based tactics adventure where every run is a unique test of your strategic skill. Adapt to unpredictable foes, navigate random events, and unleash devastating synergies between your heroes in this unforgiving roguelike world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ENDLESS HERO BUILDS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 unique hero abilities at your disposal, each run offers fresh opportunities to craft powerful builds. Enhance your party\u2019s synergy through ability upgrades, unlock mechanic-changing Blessings as you level up, and discover more than 200 unique items to maximize your potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your party on a solo journey or join forces with up to three friends in fast-paced co-op. Enjoy a dynamic system where all players act simultaneously, ensuring that no moment is wasted as you battle for the realm\u2019s survival.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SAVE THE REALM FROM DIVINE WARFARE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>Step into a realm torn apart by divine conflict. Lead a party from 5 playable heroes, resurrected by the Goddess of Light, to combat the encroaching forces of darkness. Experience the relentless cycle of death and rebirth as your mortal champions face an eternal struggle between hope and corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>STRATEGIC ROGUELIKE COMBAT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a turn-based tactics adventure where every run is a unique test of your strategic skill. Adapt to unpredictable foes, navigate random events, and unleash devastating synergies between your heroes in this unforgiving roguelike world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ENDLESS HERO BUILDS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 unique hero abilities at your disposal, each run offers fresh opportunities to craft powerful builds. Enhance your party\u2019s synergy through ability upgrades, unlock mechanic-changing Blessings as you level up, and discover more than 200 unique items to maximize your potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your party on a solo journey or join forces with up to three friends in fast-paced co-op. Enjoy a dynamic system where all players act simultaneously, ensuring that no moment is wasted as you battle for the realm\u2019s survival.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into a realm torn by divine conflict where every defeat is just another beginning in this roguelike, turn-based tactics adventure. Assemble your party, and defy fate in a world where every decision tips the balance between light and shadow.",
